  "description": "Embeddable and standalone MQTT broker library for .NET with MQTT 5.0 and MQTT 3.1.1 over TCP, TLS, WebSocket and secure WebSocket, several listeners at once. Retained messages, sessions with offline queues, shared subscriptions, an access validator for CONNECT, PUBLISH and SUBSCRIBE, pluggable stores, in-process publish and listen and administrative statistics. Runs on .NET Framework 4.7.2, .NET Standard 2.1 and .NET 8 to .NET 11. Use PLCcom.Mqtt.Client for your own clients.",
